本仓库的内容分两部分，适用不同的条款。
This repository has two parts, each under different terms.

1. 代码 / Code — MIT License
   tools/ 目录下的全部文件（脚本和页面模板），以及由它们生成的页面框架代码。
   Everything under tools/ (scripts and page templates), and the page
   scaffolding generated from them.

2. 曲目内容 / Song content — 不授权 / NOT licensed
   songs/ 目录下的全部文件，包括伴奏音频（backing.mp3）、和弦谱
   （song.json、chords.md）和由它们生成的页面。原曲的词、曲和录音版权
   归原权利人所有，本仓库不授予任何许可。详见 DISCLAIMER.md。
   Everything under songs/, including the backing audio (backing.mp3), the
   chord charts (song.json, chords.md) and the pages generated from them.
   The copyright in the original compositions and sound recordings belongs to
   their respective owners. No license of any kind is granted for this
   content. See DISCLAIMER.md.

